# scratch output from the browser MCP tool
.playwright-mcp/

# a tool's own scratch space (a probe, a one-off measurement); never committed. BOTH
# SPELLINGS, because one measurement folder was called `.tmp-measure` and none of the
# three ignore lists matched it — seven scratch files sat one `git add -A` from the tree.
**/.tmp/
**/.tmp-*/

# A CONTACT SHEET IS A PROBE, AND ONE OF THEM GOT COMMITTED. The brand-marks sweep looks
# at every candidate on an assembled sheet before keeping any; `mercury-contact-1.png`
# (144 KB) was written at the REPO ROOT rather than inside a `.tmp-*` folder, so neither
# rule above matched it and it landed in a commit with no provenance and no ledger entry —
# which CLAUDE.md requires of every picture in this repo. Pictures that are kept live under
# `public/` or `data/` with a ledger; a loose one at the root is always a probe.
/*.png
/*.jpg
/*.jpeg
/*.webp
